# Payloads and Large Air-Gap Artifacts
payloads/bin/*
!payloads/bin/.gitkeep
payloads/packages/*
!payloads/packages/.gitkeep
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.tar.zst
*.iso
*.qcow2

# Target Configs and Secrets
*.env
!versions.env
!target.env.example
*.pem
*.key
id_rsa*
id_*
known_hosts
kubeconfig
*.kubeconfig

# Terraform / OpenTofu
.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfvars
!terraform.tfvars.example
.terraform.lock.hcl
